    "reviews": "\u201cPhantom Rose 2 Sapphire is a game that can be enjoyed in short bursts or lengthy play sessions, offering a well-balanced experience across all its systems. The roguelite mechanics are accessible and don\u2019t impede natural progression, and the diverse cards create excellent moments of strategic and challenging battles. While the narrative delivery could be refined, very little should deter you from enjoying the cathartic action of Phantom Rose 2 Sapphire.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 Noisy Pixel<br><br>\u201cPlayers will have a blast with this fully formed deckbuilder, both in terms of replay and strategy, not to mention incredible load times.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 WayTooManyGames<br>",
